  Slug: cosmos
  DisplayName: Cosmos
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/cosmos-mystery.webp
  Description: "Celestial bodies great and small exert influence on you, giving you
    sublime cosmic power. Perhaps you see the glittering stars as a divine blessing,
    or perhaps you feel drawn to the infinitely dark spaces between. You might uphold
    deities like Desna, Sarenrae, or the deific lovers Shizuru and Tsukiyo who represent
    the sun and the moon\u2014or you might draw power from dark entities from beyond
    the stars, like certain Outer Gods, or destructive gods of the night like Zon-Kuthon
    or the rat goddess Lao Shu Po. Granted Spells cantrip: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Light]
    1st: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dizzying Colors] 2nd: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkness]
    5th: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Moon Frenzy] Revelation Spells initial:
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spray of Stars] advanced: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Interstellar
    Void] greater: @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Moonlight Bridge] Related
    Domains darkness, moon, nothingness, star Mystery Skill Nature Oracle Feat @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Oracular
    Warning] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Curse of the Sky's Call]"
